WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.279 --> 00:00:07.325
Tap a disk in the palette to put it on the board.

2
00:00:07.325 --> 00:00:12.450
Today’s task: build 34, then break it a second way.

3
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.753
The total at the top keeps count: 3 tens and 4 ones.

4
00:00:14.753 --> 00:00:17.171
Drag a disk to move it.

5
00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:20.992
Hold a disk to open its actions, then pick Break.

6
00:00:20.992 --> 00:00:23.020
Now it is 2 tens and 14 ones. The total is still 34.

7
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:27.810
Drag across empty board to select many pieces at once.

8
00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:30.437
Drag one of them and they all move together.

9
00:00:30.437 --> 00:00:37.275
Tap one of ten ones, then Regroup makes them one ten.

10
00:00:37.275 --> 00:00:46.024
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
